menu "Butler status LED"

    config BT_LED_GPIO
        int "GPIO of the WS2812 status LED"
        default 8
        help
            The on-board RGB LED of the ESP32-C6-DevKitC-1 and ESP32-C3-DevKitM-1 is on GPIO8. Check your board's
            schematic for others (README.md, "Other boards").

    config BT_LED_ORDER_RGB
        bool "The LED takes its colours in R-G-B order"
        default y
        help
            A WS2812 takes G-R-B, but the LED on the ESP32-C6-DevKitC-1 boards tested so far takes R-G-B.
            Turn this off if ./bt.sh led-test shows red where it says green.

endmenu
